bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수강학점 : 6학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 수강료 : 학점당 35,000원.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 단, 영어, 컴퓨터, 예능계 교과목은 시간당 35,000원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【 시간당 강좌 : 영어회화Ⅰ,영어회화Ⅱ,컴퓨터기초 】</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">5. 수강 신청&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 지원자격 :&nbsp; 금오공대 재학생(4학년 2학기 이상 이수자 제외)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;신청기한 :&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">. 05. 18(화)까지</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;<br></span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 다. 신청장소 : 종합학사행정실<br>&nbsp; 라. 제출서류 : 타대학수학신청원(붙임서식참조)<br><br>6. 교과목 폐강</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 수강인원이 10명 미만일 경우 폐강함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 폐강과목은</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 2010.05.28(금)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 안동대학교 홈페이지에 공지할 예정임.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 폐강</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">된 경우에만 수강료 반환 및 수강변경이 가능함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 수강변경기간 : 2010.06.01(화) 1일간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">7. 학점 및 성적 처리 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-. &nbsp;성적발송 : 2010.07.23(금) 이후</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 성적 조회 : 2010. 7. 20(화) 이후 안동대학교 홈페이지 종합정보시스템에서 확인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">8. 기타 문의는 안동대학교 학사관리과로 연락바랍니다.(☏ 054-820-7036)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>** 붙임화일참조 : 2010 안동대학교 여름계절수업 수업시간표 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
